TEAM
====

TEAM is a research assistance adaptation of Lancer and pi-gui, powered by Pi.
TEAM modifications include persistent research team workflows, guided user discussion,
evidence/version tracking, research archives, editable document export and TEAM artwork.
Source: https://github.com/chengyingzh433-stack/TEAM
Lancer upstream: https://github.com/raylee-ai/lancer

